/* Ad080: two DATA sections in one file: both sections reuse entity-id range #1..#N; readers with a single #-keyed map silently overwrite first section; greedy regex parsers may match across ENDSEC; boundary; illegal per ISO 10303-21 Ed.2; See also Lh024, Ls024; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
